# ⚠⚠ NEVER COMMIT THESE. Purged from history 2026-09-23 before this repo went
# public. logs/ carry real Bluetooth device addresses; docs/source/ holds captured
# system state -- Apple System Profiler reports and ioreg dumps with the machine's
# hardware serial number. Both are kept locally and backed up; neither belongs on
# GitHub. Re-adding either is how the purge gets silently undone.
logs/
docs/source/

# ⚠⚠ THE SCRUB LIST ITSELF. .scrub-identifiers holds the REAL device addresses that
# sync-to-github.sh scans the public export FOR. A scanner must never publish the thing
# it scans for, so the list is gitignored exactly as airport-extreme does it. It is
# kept locally and in the Pi backup bundles; it is not in any repo.
.scrub-identifiers
